- if @agent.is_oem?
  .alert.alert-success
    本系统只支持QQ邮箱作为发件箱，如果您不是QQ邮箱用户，请先注册QQ邮箱。并检查如下配置是否正确：
    %br
    %ol
      %li 您的QQ邮箱及独立密码设置正确(注意必须为独立密码)
      %li 确认您所使用的QQ邮箱已经开启了SMTP功能
      %li QQ邮箱根据不同用户类型设置了不同的发送总数的限制：普通用户：每天最大发信量是100封；QQ会员：VIP1~VIP7每天最大发信量是500封。发送延时 45，新激活的QQ邮箱，14天后才能使用POP3/SMTP功能 。

= form_for @agent, url: agentsys_update_profile_path, html: {class: "form-horizontal", role: "form"} do |f|
  - if @agent.errors.any?
    #error_explanation
      %h2= "#{@agent.errors.count}个错误导致无法正确保存:"
      %ul
        - @agent.errors.full_messages.each do |msg|
          %li= msg
  .field.form-group
    = f.label :name , class: "col-sm-2 control-label"
    .col-sm-4
      = f.text_field :name, class: "form-control", disabled: true
  .field.form-group
    = f.label :agent_no , class: "col-sm-2 control-label"
    .col-sm-4
      = f.text_field :agent_no, class: "form-control", disabled: true
      请将此邀请码提供给你的客户用于注册时使用，填入后系统会自动识别该客户是由你开发
  .field.form-group
    = f.label :phone , class: "col-sm-2 control-label"
    .col-sm-4
      = f.text_field :phone, class: "form-control"
      客户可以通过电话联系到您
  .field.form-group
    = f.label :qq , class: "col-sm-2 control-label"
    .col-sm-4
      = f.text_field :qq, class: "form-control"
      客户可以通过qq号联系到您
  .field.form-group
    = f.label :company_name , class: "col-sm-2 control-label"
    .col-sm-4
      = f.text_field :company_name, class: "form-control"
  .field.form-group
    = f.label :wechat_introduce_url , class: "col-sm-2 control-label"
    .col-sm-4
      = f.text_field :wechat_introduce_url, class: "form-control"
  .field.form-group
    = f.label :brand , class: "col-sm-2 control-label"
    .col-sm-4
      = f.text_field :brand, class: "form-control", disabled:  !@agent.is_oem?
      您开发的客户都会显示该点单品牌取代点单通，OEM厂商可以定义自主品牌
  - if @agent.is_oem?
    .field.form-group
      = f.label :logo , class: "col-sm-2 control-label"
      .col-sm-4
        = f.file_field :logo, class: "form-control"
        (推荐图片尺寸为400*400)
        - if (@agent.logo.thumb.url.present? rescue false)
          %br
          = image_tag @agent.logo.thumb.url, width: 150
    .field.form-group
      = f.label :rect_logo , class: "col-sm-2 control-label"
      .col-sm-4
        = f.file_field :rect_logo, class: "form-control"
        (推荐图片尺寸为800*300)
        - if (@agent.rect_logo.thumb.url.present? rescue false)
          %br
          = image_tag @agent.rect_logo.thumb.url, height: 150
  .field.form-group
    = f.label :domain , class: "col-sm-2 control-label"
    .col-sm-4
      = f.text_field :domain, class: "form-control", placeholder: "例如：#{Ddt::Host::DEPLOY}", disabled:  !@agent.is_oem?
      OEM厂商可以定义独立后台域名，请勿带'http'以及斜杠'/'
  .field.form-group
    = f.label :user_id, class: 'col-sm-2 control-label'
    .col-sm-8
      = f.text_field :user_id, data: { column: 'id_eq', single: true, url: agentsys_users_path, saved: @agent.user.try(:select_json), placeholder: "请先关注公众号ddt2013"}, class: 'ddb-select2'
      .hint
        = raw("请先关注点单通公众号服务号(微信号ddt2013)，或扫描如下二维码，然后输入用户名,电话或昵称搜索，用于获取微信通知。如果仍然找不到您自己的微信昵称，请发送@并点击返回的消息绑定你的微信。<br/><img src='#{image_url('ddt/images/ddt2013_qrcode.png')}' width='150'/><br/><div class='btn btn-xs btn-warning' onclick='reset_select_user()'>清除对应微信用户</div>")
  .field.form-group
    = f.label :email_address , class: "col-sm-2 control-label"
    .col-sm-4
      = f.text_field :email_address, class: "form-control", disabled:  true
      只支持QQ邮箱，故此处只能填写smtp.qq.com
  .field.form-group
    = f.label :email_user_name , class: "col-sm-2 control-label"
    .col-sm-4
      = f.text_field :email_user_name, class: "form-control", disabled:  !@agent.is_oem?
      OEM厂商可以定义自己的发件邮箱，例如：10000@qq.com，注意：只支持QQ邮箱
  .field.form-group
    = f.label :email_password , class: "col-sm-2 control-label"
    .col-sm-4
      = f.password_field :email_password, class: "form-control", disabled:  !@agent.is_oem?
      必须为QQ邮箱独立密码


  .actions.col-sm-offset-2


    = f.submit '提交', :class=>"btn btn-primary"
    = link_to '返回', :back, :class=>"btn btn-success"
